== accesses that differ from Gson ==
empty document | rejected: empty document at line 1 column 1 (Gson: JsonNull.INSTANCE)
null then trailing | rejected: did not consume the entire document at line 1 column 6 (Gson: JsonNull.INSTANCE)
null as string | UnsupportedOperationException: JsonNull (Gson: com.google.gson.JsonNull)
object as string | UnsupportedOperationException: JsonObject (Gson: com.google.gson.JsonObject)
one-element array as string | 1 (Gson: 1)
two-element array as string | teyru.IllegalStateException: Array must have size 1, but has size 2 (Gson: java.lang.IllegalStateException, same message)
primitive as object | teyru.IllegalStateException: Not a JSON Object: 1 (Gson: java.lang.IllegalStateException, same message)
bad int | teyru.IllegalArgumentException: For input string: "12.5" (Gson: java.lang.NumberFormatException, same message)
bad int text | teyru.IllegalArgumentException: For input string: " 13 " (Gson: java.lang.NumberFormatException, same message)
char primitive | "x" isString=true (Gson: "x" isString=true)
